{"id":"80b21a90a0262f70","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md","title":"闭项说谎者在每个一致固定点中未定义","display":"thm-liar-sentence-properties — 闭项说谎者在每个一致固定点中未定义","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-liar-sentence-properties","aliases":["91-thm-liar-sentence-properties","91-thm-liar-properties","91-thm-liar-characterization"],"display":"thm-liar-sentence-properties — 闭项说谎者在每个一致固定点中未定义","depends_on":["[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-liar-sentence-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-liar-sentence-properties</span><span>91-thm-liar-properties</span><span>91-thm-liar-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-liar-sentence-properties — 闭项说谎者在每个一致固定点中未定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\">\\(\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\\)</span>，闭项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> 的标准值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\)</span>，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a> 的直接自指实现。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq C_T\">\\(X\\subseteq C_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(X)=X\">\\(J(X)=X\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 为相应强 Kleene 评估。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\\quad\nv_X(\\lambda)=\\mathbf u,\n\\qquad\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\\quad\nv_X(\\lambda)=\\mathbf u,\n\\qquad\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定点透明性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X(T(l))=v_X(\\lambda)\">\\(v_X(T(l))=v_X(\\lambda)\\)</span>，而语法上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\">\\(\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X(\\lambda)=\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}v_X(\\lambda)\">\\(v_X(\\lambda)=\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}v_X(\\lambda)\\)</span>。在一致三值集合中仅 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span> 是这个否定方程的解。最后用固定点的真、假支持等价得成员结论。\n这里没有把 PA 可证的一般对角双条件当作三值透明等价，亦没有量化允许过剩的四值固定点。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 15.1 的闭项自指构造（印刷页 183–184，PDF 页 194–195）；\n§15.1 的 Lemmas 15.7、15.13–15.14（印刷页 191、195–196，PDF 页 202、206–207）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\lambda=\\neg T(l)$，闭项 $l$ 的标准值为 $\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner$，使用 [[91-df-liar-sentence]] 的直接自指实现。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda=\\neg T(l)","display":false},{"tex":"l","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq C_T","display":false},{"tex":"J(X)=X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"v_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\\quad\nv_X(\\lambda)=\\mathbf u,\n\\qquad\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X.","display":true},{"tex":"v_X(T(l))=v_X(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=\\neg T(l)","display":false},{"tex":"v_X(\\lambda)=\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}v_X(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false}],"bytes":1586,"backlinks":[{"id":"e382a4415fd419dc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da74a4922b7a5745","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-liar-s